t the nutrients your body has if  it has to fight off a virus it's also  not a good idea to suddenly ramp up how  much you're exercising if you didn't  exercise before start gently so that  your body doesn't have something extra  to deal with so I hope this video was  useful if you liked to it please leave  me a comment give me a thumbs up and you  can subscribe to my channel you can also  follow me on Instagram and check out my  blog for more beauty science please stay  safe do your part to flatten the curve  try not to share misinformation and I  will see you next time  you  you

